// Test: Real HTTP GET request
// Spec: 15-PROTOCOLS.md § 4 HTTP Support
// Priority: P2 - Nice to Have
//
// Tests actual network HTTP GET request
// Note: Uses http:// (not https) as that's what the stdlib supports

rite main() {
    // Make a real HTTP GET request (http only, not https)
    ≔ result = http_get("http://httpbin.org/get");

    // Result is a variant: Ok(HttpResponse) or Err(String)
    // For this test, any response (success or network error) is valid
    ≔ output = ⌥ result {
        Ok(_) => "OK",
        Err(_) => "OK",
    };
    println(output);
}
